<p class="docs-kicker">Integrations</p>
<h1>ContHunt MCP</h1>
<p class="docs-lede">Hosted remote MCP for TikTok, Instagram Reels, and YouTube Shorts research. Streamable HTTP and OAuth. No local process.</p>

<dl class="docs-meta">
    <div>
        <dt>URL</dt>
        <dd>https://mcp.conthunt.app</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
        <dt>Auth</dt>
        <dd>OAuth 2.1 + PKCE</dd>
    </div>
</dl>

